        "original_id": "15c158de-ff75-5525-b895-ed40fbb400aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Annette Bening, Howard Deutch, John Hughes, Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Stephanie Faracy\n- Works: The Great Outdoors, The Grifters, American Beauty, Being Julia, The Kids Are All Right\n- Awards: Academy Award nominations, Hollywood Walk of Fame\n\nFacts:\n- Annette Carol Bening was born on May 29, 1958, and she is an American actress.\n- The Great Outdoors is a 1988 American comedy film directed by Howard Deutch and written and produced by John Hughes.\n- The Great Outdoors stars Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Stephanie Faracy, and Annette Bening, and it was Annette Bening's film debut.\n- Annette Bening received Academy Award nominations for The Grifters (1990), American Beauty (1999), Being Julia (2004), and The Kids Are All Right (2010).\n- In 2006, Annette Bening received a star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame.",
